{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Perhaps there will lack five.</b> And the meaning is: perhaps a tenth of the number will be lacking," "and the reason for \"destroy\" with five is because of the five that would be lacking from the whole, and afterward he said: perhaps a ninth of the number that I stated will be lacking — if they are found there I will not destroy them."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:59.569116768Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}